# Netlify Redirect Rules for Infamous Freight

# Redirect platform subdomains
https://app.infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/ 301!
https://admin.infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/ 301!
https://dispatch.infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/ 301!
https://driver.infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/ 301!
https://broker.infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/ 301!
https://carrier.infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/ 301!

# Redirect apex to canonical www
https://infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/:splat 301!
https://infamous-freight.netlify.app/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/:splat 301!

# Redirect old domain paths
/old-page /new-page 301!
/legacy/* /new-path/:splat 301!

# Browser-critical API health proxy
/api/health https://infamous-freight.fly.dev/api/health 200!

# Netlify-hosted API endpoints
/api/load-requests /.netlify/functions/load-requests 200!
/api/load-requests/* /.netlify/functions/load-requests/:splat 200!
/api/public/quote-requests /.netlify/functions/public-freight 200!
/api/public/shipments/:trackingNumber /.netlify/functions/public-freight?trackingNumber=:trackingNumber 200!
/api/auth/* /.netlify/functions/accounts 200!
/api/loads /.netlify/functions/loads 200!
/api/loads/* /.netlify/functions/loads 200!
/api/carriers /.netlify/functions/carriers 200!
/api/carriers/* /.netlify/functions/carriers 200!
/api/drivers /.netlify/functions/drivers 200!
/api/drivers/* /.netlify/functions/drivers 200!
/api/eld/drivers/:driverId/hos /.netlify/functions/drivers 200!
/api/tracking/* /.netlify/functions/tracking 200!
/api/quotes /.netlify/functions/quotes 200!
/api/quotes/* /.netlify/functions/quotes 200!
/api/documents/* /.netlify/functions/documents 200!
/api/invoices /.netlify/functions/invoices 200!
/api/invoices/* /.netlify/functions/invoices 200!
/api/notifications /.netlify/functions/notifications-api 200!
/api/notifications/* /.netlify/functions/notifications-api 200!
/api/mobile/* /.netlify/functions/mobile 200!

# Do not expose source maps from production deploys
/*.map /404 404!

# Production API proxy
/api/* https://infamous-freight.fly.dev/api/:splat 200!
/socket.io/* https://infamous-freight.fly.dev/socket.io/:splat 200!

# SPA fallback - serve index.html for all routes
/*    /index.html   200
